**We do not sell your personal information to third parties.**

## Your Rights and Choices

You have the following rights regarding your data:

### Access and Portability
- View all your habit data within the App
- Export your data by contacting us

### Modification
- Edit or update your habits and account information at any time

### Deletion
- Delete individual habits or logs
- Delete your entire account through Settings > Account > Delete Account
- Request complete data deletion by contacting us

### Notifications
- Enable or disable notifications in iOS Settings
- Customize notification times within the App

### Subscription Management
- Manage subscriptions through iOS Settings > [Your Name] > Subscriptions
- Cancel at any time without penalty

## Data Retention

- **Active Accounts**: Data retained while your account is active
- **Deleted Accounts**: All data permanently deleted within 30 days
- **Inactive Accounts**: Accounts inactive for 3+ years may be deleted with prior notice
- **Subscription Data**: Retained as required by Apple and tax regulations

## Children's Privacy

Our App is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe we have collected such information, please contact us immediately.

## International Data Transfers

Your information may be transferred to and processed in countries other than your own. We ensure appropriate safeguards are in place to protect your data in accordance with this Privacy Policy.

## California Privacy Rights (CCPA)

If you are a California resident, you have additional rights:
- Right to know what personal data is collected
- Right to know if personal data is sold or disclosed
- Right to opt-out of the sale of personal data (we do not sell data)
- Right to deletion of personal data
- Right to non-discrimination for exercising your rights

## European Privacy Rights (GDPR)

If you are in the European Economic Area, you have rights under GDPR:
- Right to access your personal data
- Right to rectification of inaccurate data
- Right to erasure ("right to be forgotten")
- Right to restrict processing
- Right to data portability
- Right to object to processing
- Right to withdraw consent

